Package: brandkit
Title: Opinionated Brand Theming Toolkit for R
Version: 0.3.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Luwi", "", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "lukaswillocx@gmail.com")
Description: A convenience layer on top of the brand.yml ecosystem that
    auto-applies consistent branding across Shiny, ggplot2, plotly, gt, DT,
    Quarto, and R Markdown from a single '_brand.yml' file. Includes smart
    palette generation and CSS overrides for third-party widgets that
    Bootstrap 5 does not reach.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
License: MIT + file LICENSE
